{"parse": {"title": "冰岩标本", "pageid": 105798, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"冰岩标本\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9d/CurrencyItem-2801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"冰岩标本\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>冰岩标本</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-2801 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-2801_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#2801</div></div><hr /><div>自极地的冰岩上凿下的标本，等待接受进一步的研究。用于在“雪橇速递”兑换奖励商品。<br />仅限[复乐园]活动举办期间使用。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">它自地底而来，被熔融、折叠、挤压，沉入水底，又浮上海面。然而，总有人能从中读出，那些关于上一个冰河时代或是更久远年月的秘密。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "冰岩标本"}}